### Lista todos os quartos
GET http://localhost:7070/rooms

### Cria reserva STANDARD
POST http://localhost:7070/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "102",
  "guestName": "João Silva",
  "guestEmail": "joao@example.com",
  "guestCpf": "12345678900",
  "checkIn": "2027-03-10",
  "checkOut": "2027-03-12",
  "guests": 2,
  "ratePlan": "STANDARD"
}

### Cria reserva NON_REFUNDABLE (15% desconto)
POST http://localhost:7070/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "101",
  "guestName": "Maria Santos",
  "guestEmail": "maria@example.com",
  "guestCpf": "98765432100",
  "checkIn": "2027-07-10",
  "checkOut": "2027-07-12",
  "guests": 1,
  "ratePlan": "NON_REFUNDABLE"
}

