### Cria reserva LONG_STAY (7+ noites, 10% desconto)
POST http://localhost:7070/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "301",
  "guestName": "Pedro Alves",
  "guestEmail": "pedro@example.com",
  "guestCpf": "99988877766",
  "checkIn": "2027-03-01",
  "checkOut": "2027-03-08",
  "guests": 3,
  "ratePlan": "LONG_STAY"
}

### Consulta reserva
GET http://localhost:7070/reservations/1

### Confirma reserva (recebe pagamento)
POST http://localhost:7070/reservations/1/confirmation

### Faz check-in
POST http://localhost:7070/reservations/1/check-in

### Faz check-out e recebe comprovante
POST http://localhost:7070/reservations/1/check-out

### Segunda via do comprovante
GET http://localhost:7070/reservations/1/document

### Cancela reserva
POST http://localhost:7070/reservations/2/cancellation

### Lista mensagens enviadas
GET http://localhost:7070/messages

### Relatório de ocupação
GET http://localhost:7070/reports/occupancy?date=2027-03-10

### Relatório de receita
GET http://localhost:7070/reports/revenue?month=2027-03
